@startuml agentic-service-value-stream-boundary
title Agentic Service vs Agentic Value Stream Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Agentic Value Stream" as avs
class "Agentic Service" as asvc

avs --> asvc : uses (one or more)

note right of avs
  End-to-end value realization
  materially involving agentic behavior
end note

note right of asvc
  Service-level delivery
  or interaction
end note

note bottom
  Agentic Service does NOT
  imply Agentic Value Stream
  per ADR-ES-014 §10
  per ASVC-NEG-005
end note
@enduml
